{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17849","headline":"奉和仆射相公酬忠武李相公见寄之作 · 令狐楚","name":"奉和仆射相公酬忠武李相公见寄之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丽藻飞来自相庭，五文相错八音清。\n初瞻绮色连霞色，又听金声继玉声。\n才出山西文与武，欢从塞北弟兼兄。\n白头老尹三川上，双和阳春喜复惊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17849.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17849","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}